WEB SOURCE (the specification — read end to end)
  web/src/components/charts/AddAnnotationPopover.tsx — the "add a chart annotation" modal. A pure local form
  (its only hook is `useTranslation`; there is NO data query, NO loading/error/fetch state). Props:
  `open`, `timestamp`, `onAdd(label, category, description?, occurredAt)`, `onCancel`, `editableDate=false`.
    Render (web <Modal size="sm" title=t('annotation.addTitle','Add Annotation')>):
      • editableDate ? <Input type="date" value=editedDate label=t('annotation.date','Date')
        max={toDateInputValue(now)} required> : <div class="text-xs text-gray-400">{timestamp}</div>
      • <Input value=label placeholder=t('annotation.labelHint*,'e.g., Battery replaced') autoFocus
        maxLength=50 label=t('annotation.label','Label')>
      • Category pills: CATEGORY_OPTIONS.map → button(icon + t('annotation.cat.<value>', label)); selected pill
        is `border-current` + tinted bg + style={{color: ANNOTATION_COLORS[value]}}. Order: milestone,
        maintenance, trip, issue, upgrade, custom.
      • <Input value=description placeholder=t('annotation.descHint*,'Optional description...') maxLength=200
        label=t('annotation.description','Description')>
      • Footer: <Button variant=ghost onClick=handleClose>{t('common.cancel','Cancel')}</Button> +
        <Button type=submit disabled={!label.trim()}>{t('annotation.add','Add Annotation')}</Button>
    Helpers (reproduced verbatim — the contract):
      toDateInputValue(ts):  ""⇒""; new Date(ts) valid ⇒ UTC "yyyy-MM-dd" (getUTC*); invalid ⇒ keep iff already
                             "yyyy-MM-dd", else "".
      toIsoTimestamp(d):     ""⇒""; "yyyy-MM-dd" ⇒ "<d>T00:00:00Z"; else "".
      handleSubmit:          if(!label.trim()) return; occurredAt = editableDate ? toIsoTimestamp(editedDate) :
                             timestamp; if(!occurredAt) return; onAdd(label.trim(), category,
                             description.trim()||undefined, occurredAt); then reset label/category/description.
      handleClose:           reset label/category/description, then onCancel().
      useEffect([open,timestamp]): on open, setEditedDate(toDateInputValue(timestamp)).
      ANNOTATION_COLORS: milestone #3b82f6, maintenance #f59e0b, trip #22c55e, issue #ef4444, upgrade #a855f7,
                         custom #94a3b8.

